Type: Package
Package: SurfaceMesh
Title: 3D Surface Meshes Based on 'CGAL'
Version: 0.0.3
Authors@R:
    c(person("Daniel", "Wollschlaeger",
             role=c("aut", "cre"),
             email="wollschlaeger@uni-mainz.de"),
      person("Stephane", "Laurent", role="aut"),
      person("The CGAL Project",    role="cph"))
Maintainer: Daniel Wollschlaeger <wollschlaeger@uni-mainz.de>
Description: Processing of 3D surface meshes based on the 'C++'
    library for computational geometry 'CGAL'
    (<https://www.cgal.org/>).
    Reads and writes common file formats for meshes and
    polygon soups.
    Supports mesh repair, remeshing, subdivision, Boolean
    operations on bounded volumes, outlier removal, surface
    reconstruction, (optimal) bounding box, bounding sphere,
    bounding ellipsoid,
    convex hull, vertex normals, surface distance metrics
    (such as Hausdorff), and volume-overlap similarity measures
    ('JSC', 'DSC').
    Adapts code from packages 'Boov' and 'cgalMeshes'
    developed by Stephane Laurent.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/dwoll/SurfaceMesh/
